              "id": "8cc2157e-2f43-4621-8655-3df40cc015e2",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Table Games of Georgian &amp; Victorian Days</strong></em> was written by F. R. B. Whitehouse, published by Peter Garnett, January 1, 1951."
